  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "两个既有 Session 子场景",
      "items": [
        "F09：upCnxState=ACTIVATING，Host 路由到已有 SM Context；Owner 返回 N2 setup 信息，AMF 完成 AN setup 后再回传 PDU_RES_SETUP_RSP",
        "F10：按 hoState / N2 handover / PATH_SWITCH_REQ 识别 handover generation，OpenAMSM 更新已有用户面路径",
        "两个分支都不调用 Establishment 的 s1 / s3，不创建第二个 SM Context",
        "NGAP exchange：PDU Session Resource Setup Request / PDU Session Resource Setup Response；图中使用 PDU Resource Setup Request / Response 短标签"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "Owner 与 N4 责任",
      "items": [
        "ACTIVATING 可使用 OpenAMSM 私有 smContextUpdateSync；它不是 3GPP Nsmf_PDUSession_UpdateSMContext",
        "FAR / F-TEID 变更由 OpenAMSM SMF 处理，PFCP Type 52/53 直连 UPF",
        "hoState=COMPLETED 与 CANCELLED 是不同终态；取消不等于成功迁移",
        "PFCP standard messages：Session Modification Request / Response（Type 52/53）；FAR / F-TEID 由 OpenAMSM SMF 更新。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "slate",
      "title": "Host / Provider 边界",
      "items": [
        "AMF 的 UpdateSMContext 始终经 SCP 到 Host Location",
        "Host 负责既有资源定位、N2 附件与响应配对；Client Tools 负责固定 Owner 出站绑定",
        "本流程是既有 Session 的协议路由 / Owner 更新，不自动创建新 Skill Invocation"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "slate",
      "title": "3GPP Service Operation 与既有 Session",
      "items": [
        "所有 AMF → SMF 请求均为 Nsmf_PDUSession_UpdateSMContext（OpenAPI operationId=UpdateSmContext）",
        "F09 由 upCnxState=ACTIVATING 识别 Service Request；F10 按 hoState / PATH_SWITCH_REQ 识别 Handover / Path Switch",
        "两类分支都只更新既有 SM Context，不重跑 Establishment；PFCP Type 52/53 由 OpenAMSM 直连 UPF"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
